    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11[b]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 11[b]</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="11[b]" corresp="#wit-b">[11[b]] orceard ræran 7 mænige inweorc wyrcean, ðerhsan, wudu cleofan, hryðeran styllan, swyn stigian,</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#gobbitt" n="26.1" corresp="#wit-b">Orceard ræran . 7 mænige inweorc wyrcean. ðerhsan . wudu cleofan . hryðeran styllan. swyn stygian .</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-b">orceard ræran and mænige inweorc wyrcean, ðerhsan, wudu cleofan, hryðeran styllan, swyn stician,</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#gobbitt" corresp="#wit-b">To tend the orchard and to undertake many indoor duties, threshing, to cleave wood, put cattle in stalls, slaughter pigs.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-b">tend to the orchard, carry out indoor tasks, thresh, chop wood, put cattle in stalls, put pigs in their sty,</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Garten bauen und viele Arbeiten innerhalb [des Gehöfts] thun, dreschen, Holz spalten, den Rindern Stall machen, Schweine einpferchen,</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">lay out an orchard and do many indoor tasks, thresh, split wood, make stalls for the cattle, pen the pigs,</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares Gerefa 13 and Rect 7.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
